  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n80 : 17 :: ? : 13 :: 185 : 38\n\n**Logic:** First no. = [(Second no. × 5) - 5]\n\n**80 : 17 →**\n\n⇒ [(17 × 5) - 5]\n\n⇒ (85 - 5) = 80\n\n**185 : 38 →**\n\n⇒ [(38 × 5) - 5]\n\n⇒ (190 - 5) = 185\n\nSimilarly, for '? : 13' →\n\n⇒ [(13 × 5) - 5]\n\n⇒ (65 - 5) = **60**\n\nHere, **'60 : 13'** is the correct pair.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (2)\".",
